---
title: "cancel (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is projectAdmin or Legion operator
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_not_published: authorized
    q_check_not_published --> q_set_cancelled: results not yet published
    q_check_not_published --> q_revert_published: results already published
    q_revert_published --> [*]: revert ResultsAlreadyPublished
    q_set_cancelled --> q_emit: saleCanceled = true
    q_emit --> [*]: emit SaleCanceled(caller)

    note right of q_check_not_published
        INV-001: Cancel only before results publication
        INV-002: Either projectAdmin or Legion operator can cancel
        INV-003: Once canceled, no further sale operations allowed
    end note
